' The viewers of Vibe Commander: the viewer of your own that F3
' runs for a file by its extension, in place of the built-in one.
' A line such as
'
'   doc: wordview !.!
'
' names one. Alt-F3 always uses the built-in viewer.
'
' A web page cannot run commands, so this file names no viewer, and
' F3 uses the built-in one for every file.
